## Future Enhancements

- Optimize model loading and recommendation latency.
- Expand and improve fragrance-catalogue coverage.
- Evaluate recommendation quality with appropriate ranking metrics.
- Improve explanations for why a perfume was recommended.
- Deploy the application for public access.

## Disclaimer

Scent Sense is an experimental recommendation prototype. Results depend on the available perfume catalogue, its metadata, and the recommendation algorithms. Estimated fragrance characteristics are indicative rather than definitive.

